Grintion-OS @VERSION@
Minimalist - Independent - Secure - Stable

Useful commands:
  install --help            install to a disk (alias: grintion-install)
  desktop --help            install/setup GUI & desktop (XFCE, KDE, Sway, LXQt, i3)
  persist                   create persistent live storage
  chroot /mnt               enter an installed system
  doctor                    system health checks
  garb --help               package manager
  sv status /var/service/*  service status
  nft list ruleset          firewall rules

The live root is an overlay. Reboots discard changes unless persistence is active.
